  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICMPS 2021 Cbr Marist Sisters Fiji</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project focusses on educational awareness and support to our people. Participants will become first responders as agents of healing and compassion with primary reference towards the safety and protection of women and children who are survivors of domestic violence and abuse. Spaces will be provided for expressions by victims and survivors towards their empowerment. During the Covid 19 lockdown periods, families in Fiji remain together and have the opportunity to pray more and spend quality time together. However, media publications and statistics from the Women Crisis Centre report an alarming increase of domestic violence and abuse. This intervention aims to mitigate against this.</narrative>
  </description>
